      {
        "padding": 0,
        "lineHeight": 1.5,
        "id": "markdown-1",
        "kind": "text",
        "name": "Starting something new means making the same small…",
        "text": "Starting something new means making the same small decisions again and again. Where do the rules live? Which file is current? What should the next person—or agent—read first?",
        "assetId": null,
        "frame": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 1,
          "width": 12,
          "height": 1
        },
        "frames": {},
        "color": "transparent",
        "background": "transparent",
        "fontSize": 18,
        "radius": 0,
        "align": "left",
        "fit": "cover",
        "shape": "rectangle",
        "hidden": false
      },
      {
        "padding": 0,
        "lineHeight": 1.5,
        "id": "markdown-2",
        "kind": "text",
        "name": "We’re building NullDull to give that work a home. Tools…",
        "text": "We’re building NullDull to give that work a home. Tools for startups, usable by people and agents, with shared context and explicit permissions. The idea is simple: less repetitive setup, and better access to the context, configuration and resources a team already has.",
        "assetId": null,
        "frame": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 2,
          "width": 12,
          "height": 1
        },
        "frames": {},
        "color": "transparent",
        "background": "transparent",
        "fontSize": 18,
        "radius": 0,
        "align": "left",
        "fit": "cover",
        "shape": "rectangle",
        "hidden": false
      },
      {
        "padding": 0,
        "lineHeight": 1.2,
        "id": "markdown-3",
        "kind": "text",
        "name": "Memory comes first.",
        "text": "## Memory comes first.",
        "assetId": null,
        "frame": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 3,
          "width": 12,
          "height": 1
        },
        "frames": {},
        "color": "transparent",
        "background": "transparent",
        "fontSize": 28,
        "radius": 0,
        "align": "left",
        "fit": "cover",
        "shape": "rectangle",
        "hidden": false
      },
      {
        "padding": 0,
        "lineHeight": 1.5,
        "id": "markdown-4",
        "kind": "text",
        "name": "Memory holds the decisions, instructions, Markdown files…",
        "text": "Memory holds the decisions, instructions, Markdown files and private assets that help a team pick up where it left off. A workspace can keep shared guidance at its root and give each project its own files. Teams with several products can group projects under a product.",
        "assetId": null,
        "frame": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 4,
          "width": 12,
          "height": 1
        },
        "frames": {},
        "color": "transparent",
        "background": "transparent",
        "fontSize": 18,
        "radius": 0,
        "align": "left",
        "fit": "cover",
        "shape": "rectangle",
        "hidden": false
      },
      {
        "padding": 0,
        "lineHeight": 1.5,
        "id": "markdown-5",
        "kind": "text",
        "name": "Access is deliberate. Being part of the same workspace…",
        "text": "Access is deliberate. Being part of the same workspace does not mean every file or secret is available to everyone. People and agents work through the same operations and the same permission checks.",
        "assetId": null,
        "frame": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 5,
          "width": 12,
          "height": 1
        },
        "frames": {},
        "color": "transparent",
        "background": "transparent",
        "fontSize": 18,
        "radius": 0,
        "align": "left",
        "fit": "cover",
        "shape": "rectangle",
        "hidden": false
      },
      {
        "padding": 0,
        "lineHeight": 1.5,
        "id": "markdown-6",
        "kind": "text",
        "name": "Memory is available in invite-only early access. Grid, our…",
        "text": "Memory is available in invite-only early access. Grid, our page editor, is in early access too, with its own consent and its own roles.",
        "assetId": null,
        "frame": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 6,
          "width": 12,
          "height": 1
        },
        "frames": {},
        "color": "transparent",
        "background": "transparent",
        "fontSize": 18,
        "radius": 0,
        "align": "left",
        "fit": "cover",
        "shape": "rectangle",
        "hidden": false
      },
      {
        "padding": 0,
        "lineHeight": 1.2,
        "id": "markdown-7",
        "kind": "text",
        "name": "What the rest of the website is for.",
        "text": "## What the rest of the website is for.",
        "assetId": null,
        "frame": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 7,
          "width": 12,
          "height": 1
        },
        "frames": {},
        "color": "transparent",
        "background": "transparent",
        "fontSize": 28,
        "radius": 0,
