      {
        "padding": 0,
        "lineHeight": 1.5,
        "id": "markdown-12",
        "kind": "text",
        "name": "If you are new to NullDull, start with Why NullDull for…",
        "text": "If you are new to NullDull, start with Why NullDull for the thesis, then Memory for agents and teams for the product we built first. AI and memory and AI and loops explain how we think about agents more generally: why shared context needs to be durable and reviewed, and why agent loops need checkpoints and state outside the model.",
        "assetId": null,
        "frame": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 12,
          "width": 12,
          "height": 1
        },
        "frames": {},
        "color": "transparent",
        "background": "transparent",
        "fontSize": 18,
        "radius": 0,
        "align": "left",
        "fit": "cover",
        "shape": "rectangle",
        "hidden": false
      },
      {
        "padding": 0,
        "lineHeight": 1.5,
        "id": "markdown-13",
        "kind": "text",
        "name": "If you want to try something today, Support has…",
        "text": "If you want to try something today, Support has step-by-step guides, starting with Getting started with Memory and Connect your agent. Developers can find the HTTP API, the MCP and CLI references and the client SDKs in the public developer docs.",
        "assetId": null,
        "frame": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 13,
          "width": 12,
          "height": 1
        },
        "frames": {},
        "color": "transparent",
        "background": "transparent",
        "fontSize": 18,
        "radius": 0,
        "align": "left",
        "fit": "cover",
        "shape": "rectangle",
        "hidden": false
      },
      {
        "padding": 0,
        "lineHeight": 1.2,
        "id": "markdown-14",
        "kind": "text",
        "name": "How we will write here.",
        "text": "## How we will write here.",
        "assetId": null,
        "frame": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 14,
          "width": 12,
          "height": 1
        },
        "frames": {},
        "color": "transparent",
        "background": "transparent",
        "fontSize": 28,
        "radius": 0,
        "align": "left",
        "fit": "cover",
