        "hidden": false
      },
      {
        "padding": 0,
        "lineHeight": 1.5,
        "id": "markdown-15",
        "kind": "text",
        "name": "We’ll explain what exists, what is in early access, and…",
        "text": "We’ll explain what exists, what is in early access, and what is still a plan. Locale and Tasks are in early access. Feedbacks comes later. When those states change, What’s new? will say so first.",
        "assetId": null,
        "frame": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 15,
          "width": 12,
          "height": 1
        },
        "frames": {},
        "color": "transparent",
        "background": "transparent",
        "fontSize": 18,
        "radius": 0,
        "align": "left",
        "fit": "cover",
        "shape": "rectangle",
        "hidden": false
      },
      {
        "padding": 0,
        "lineHeight": 1.5,
        "id": "markdown-16",
        "kind": "text",
        "name": "No invented launch dates. No numbers we haven’t measured.…",
        "text": "No invented launch dates. No numbers we haven’t measured. No claims that a roadmap is already a release. Just the work, with enough context to follow along—and, where it helps, the reasoning behind a decision so you can disagree with it on its merits.",
        "assetId": null,
        "frame": {
